<h1 class="h3 mb-3">About the Institute of Fine Arts</h1>

<p>
    The Institute of Fine Arts teaches drawing and painting to students of every age. Our teachers organise
    painting competitions throughout the year; the best paintings receive awards and are shown at exhibitions
    across the country, where visitors can also buy them.
</p>

<h2 class="h5">Take part</h2>
<ul>
    <li>See the <a href="/competitions">competitions</a> that are open for entries or coming soon.</li>
    <li>Browse the <a href="/gallery">gallery</a> of awarded paintings.</li>
    <li>Students log in to submit their paintings and see their results.</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="h5">Contact</h2>
<p class="mb-0">Email: contact@ifa.local</p>
<p>Opening hours: Monday – Saturday, 08:00 – 17:00</p>
